# Shell scripts, the Dockerfile and the Firestore rules keep LF line endings on every
# checkout, including Windows with core.autocrlf (bash can't run a script with CRLF).
*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
*.rules text eol=lf
# The music library's themes (music/); never touched for line endings or diffed.
*.mp3 binary
